Subject: [PATCH 3/7] =?UTF-8?q?feat(fase-2):=20PON-Timer=20=E2=80=94=20tim?=
 =?UTF-8?q?erfd=20para=20notificao=20de=20expirao=20sem=20polling?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Criado pon_instigation.h: definio da entidade Instigation (temporal e
  causal), structs ErtsInstigation e ErtsTimerInstigation com stdint.h
- Criado pon_timer.c: gerenciamento de timerfd + epoll para notificao
  de expirao de timers via kernel (sem polling do timer wheel)
  - pon_timer_init/destroy: epoll fd global
  - pon_timer_instigation_create: cria timerfd, registra no epoll
  - pon_timer_instigation_cancel: fecha timerfd
  - pon_timer_instigation_fire: le timerfd, marca como fired
  - pon_timer_process_expirations: epoll_wait no bloqueante
  - Fallback para timer wheel tradicional para timers < 1ms
- pon_stats.h: adicionado contadores timerfd_created, timerfd_expirations,
  timer_wheel_fallback, timer_instigations
- Makefile.in: adicionado pon_timer.o aos objetos

Compilao verificada: standalone com -DPON_BEAM -D_GNU_SOURCE -std=c99
(0 erros, depende apenas de POSIX + pon_instigation.h)
